      "content": "yeah but it's the decay that's so heavy. watching it slowly rot is so much worse than just... not being there. like, if a beautiful song is being played badly and screeching at the end, wouldn't it be better if it just stopped while it was still beautiful? instead of letting it turn into this ugly, painful noise?",
